{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The day has finally arrived, today you will become a monster tamer! Make friends with all of them and share a wonderful adventure, together you will explore different areas, take care of the crops and defeat great enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through several areas to set up camp.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Powerful bosses.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends with over 150 different monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 600 different items.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant and protect crops from wild monsters that will try to eat them.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase the friendship of your monsters.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place various furniture in your base with different uses.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources and use them to create different items, potions, weapons and armor.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3372080?t=1770485804","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3372080?t=1770485804","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372080/f519d847d32d27f0536f3b80db6bfee29b4db12d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770485804","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372080/f519d847d32d27f0536f3b80db6bfee29b4db12d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770485804","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The day has finall